    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100796" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνοικο-δομέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>build together</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ πολλῶν ἓν οἰκητήριον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
				</span></i>
			<i>Comp.Thes. Rom.</i><i><span class="en">
				4
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1180.16
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκίαι ἐκ πλίνθων
				συνῳκοδομημέναι</span>
			<i>entirely built</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				39.61
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1648.60
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>: metaph. in 
				Pass.
			 of believers, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Eph.</u>
				2.22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be built in with other materials</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίθοι ξυνῳκοδομημένοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.93
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. οἱ κίονες τοῖς τοίχοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					13.82
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>build up, block up</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.37
			</span></i>.</div>
